  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MRC Strategic Award to establish an International Centre for Genomic Medicine in Neuromuscular Diseases</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MRC Strategic Award to to establish an International Centre for Genomic Medicine in Neuromuscular Diseases.

The overall mission is to create a transcontinental genomics research and capacity building partnership between the UK and India, Brazil, South Africa, Zambia &amp; Turkey.</narrative>
  </description>
